  "answer_markdown": "To configure **automatic user onboarding** and **sign-in without separate password credentials** for a company, the following plans and requirements apply:\n\n### **Automatic User Onboarding (Email-Domain Authentication)**\n- **Supported plans**: Team and above [6].\n- **Requirements**:\n  - A **verified domain** is mandatory [8].\n  - Users with matching email addresses (e.g., `@acme.com`) can join automatically via the [Join Organization](https://admin.mistral.ai/join) page [6].\n  - Users still **create their own credentials** (email + password) [6].\n\n### **Sign-In Without Separate Passwords (SAML SSO)**\n- **Supported plans**: **Enterprise only** [4].\n- **Requirements**:\n  - A **verified domain** is mandatory [8].\n  - Users sign in using their **corporate credentials** (e.g., Okta, Azure AD) [4].\n  - No Mistral password is required; users are redirected to the IdP for authentication [4].\n\n### **Key Differences**\n- **Email-domain authentication** (Team+) allows **automatic membership** but **not passwordless sign-in** [6].\n- **SAML SSO** (Enterprise) enables **passwordless sign-in** via corporate credentials [4].\n\n### **Verification Process**\nTo enable either feature, verify your domain by adding a DNS record [1].\n\n> **Note**: If you want **both automatic onboarding and passwordless sign-in**, you must:\n> 1. Use **Enterprise plan** for SAML SSO [4].\n> 2. Enable **email-domain authentication** (optional) for automatic membership [2].\n> 3. Ensure the domain is verified [8].",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 6,
      "quote": "Email domain authentication is available on Team plans and above."
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "quote": "Domain verification proves that you control one or more email domains."
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "quote": "Users still **create and manage their own credentials** (email and password)."
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "quote": "You need an Enterprise plan to configure SAML SSO."
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "quote": "Any user with an email address that matches your verified domain is redirected to your configured IdP to authenticate."
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "quote": "For single sign-on authentication **without separate credentials**, use [SSO](https://docs.mistral.ai/admin/set-up-organization/sign-in-method/saml-sso) instead (Enterprise plans)."
    },
